        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="MpCrRf3VQOImDC203fc6-40" value="Desktop software to handle data egress off of scientific acquisition machines.&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;A utilities library contains Protocol-matched, optimized data movement functions for various storage solutions (local, network, s3, google cloud)&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Each dataset has an &lt;b&gt;Instruction &lt;/b&gt;submitted that contains one or more &lt;b&gt;Tasks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- For example, compress this file, move data somewhere, then notify lab systems&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Instructions&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;are carried out by the bellhop engine, tracking successes and failing gracefully in a restartable manner&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Interaction occurs through a web UI, CLI, or importable python client library.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=default;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="70" width="780" height="160" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
